+| `assert.k` | 0 | 3 | 0 | 0 | 0 | Assertion success/failure/deref; used only by concrete regression tests. |
+| `bool.k` | 0 | 13 | 1 | 0 | 0 | Boolean operators and short-circuiting; unused by the target proof. |
